1.27.0: contact sheet, radial filter, keystone, sharpening, highlight
recovery, lens profiles, Z f, completions

Page:
- contact sheet: the bracket's "film stocks" axis renders the current
  look once per stock the camera takes, in one grid; a click takes the
  stock. Brackets for radial, sharpen and keystone too.
- Lens & framing shows a raw's lens (name, focal length, aperture) and
  what its profile would set; "apply profile" sets the sliders.
- new controls: radial filter (stops, center, size), sharpen, highlight
  recovery, keystone vertical/horizontal.
- cross-processing greyed out on a black-and-white camera.

Engine (new scene keys, all identity at 0, in every front end):
- radial, radialx, radialy, radialsize: stops inside a soft ellipse.
- keystonev, keystoneh: perspective correction in the lens resample;
  the widened edge's sides run off the frame, so no empty corners.
- sharpen: capture sharpening, an unsharp mask on luminance over about
  a pixel at full size, after the chroma denoise.
- recover: raw highlight reconstruction at decode time - a clipped
  sensor channel rebuilt toward the unclipped ones, neutral and bright
  up to 1.6x sensor white, instead of clipped at white (0 is
  byte-identical to before). Read by the decoder ahead of the render
  (pj_raw_set_recover); the CLI, serve and the wasm set it from the
  look.
- cross-processing is dropped on a monochrome camera or B&W film
  (nothing to cross); the CLIs say so.

Raw:
- the lens from EXIF (FocalLength, FNumber, LensSpecification,
  LensModel) and Nikon's unencrypted lens tag 0x84; pj_raw_last_lens().
- lens profiles (src/core/lensdb.c): distortion and corner falloff by
  focal length and aperture for the AF-S 24-120/4G VR, AF-S 50/1.4G,
  AF-S DX 18-55 VR, NIKKOR Z 24-70/4 S, Z 40/2, Z 28/2.8 - approximate,
  from published charts. 'polajuice apply --lens auto' sets distortion
  and devignette where they are 0; 'inspect' shows the lens and the
  profile; serve's /api/stats and the wasm's 'lens' command carry it.
- Z family color matrices from LibRaw: Z f, Z fc, Z 6/6 II, Z 5; a Z f
  image-area fallback. Unverified against a file.

Shell:
- bash and zsh completion for polajuice and superjuice (commands,
  options, cameras and films from the binaries), installed by
  'make install' under $(PREFIX)/share.

CLI: --keystonev --keystoneh --sharpen --recover --radial --radialx
--radialy --radialsize --lens; superjuice and super8ify take the same.

Tests: core (keystone, sharpen, radial, mono cross, reconstruction on
the synthetic raw, profile lookup, 25 keys), compat (round trip, cross
on bw-35, --lens auto on a JPEG), serve (lens:null, monochrome flag,
recover served = CLI), wasm (keys, recover, lens), page (controls,
cross disabled), Chromium (contact sheet with a served two-stock
library, radial bracket), install (completions).

Docs: README, RECIPES.md, PRESET_SOURCES.md (Z family, lens profiles,
highlight reconstruction), man pages.
